WEBVTT

00:05:29.671 --> 00:05:32.686
i imaš prepreke na putu, kao i svi mi.

00:05:32.686 --> 00:05:36.114
Niko nije prošao kroz život

00:05:36.114 --> 00:05:39.759
bez teškoće i boli,

00:05:39.759 --> 00:05:42.039
bez nemira,

00:05:42.039 --> 00:05:44.997
i ako vjeruješ

00:05:44.997 --> 00:05:47.393
i možeš pasti
i opet ustati

00:05:47.393 --> 00:05:50.318
i vjeruješ u istrajnost

00:05:50.318 --> 00:05:53.848
kao veliki ljudski kvalitet,

00:05:53.848 --> 00:05:56.714
naći ćeš svoj put, i Boni me zgrabi za ramena,

00:05:56.714 --> 00:06:01.254
i reče mi, "Nađimo put do Floride."